---
// spec: S05 (/board/10th)
import BoardClassPage from '../../components/BoardClassPage.astro';
---
<BoardClassPage
  cls="10th"
  heading="10th class test paper aur guess paper"
  intro="Matric part 2 ke final ki tayyari: apne chapters ke mutabiq board pattern paper."
  subjects={['English', 'Urdu', 'Pakistan Studies', 'Tarjuma-tul-Quran', 'Maths', 'Physics', 'Chemistry', 'Biology', 'Computer Science', 'General Science']}
  faq={[
    { q: 'Kya poore syllabus ka paper mil sakta hai?', a: 'Haan. Chapters mein "poora syllabus" likh dein aur kul number batayen; paper board ke final jaisa banega.' },
    { q: '9th ke chapters bhi shamil ho sakte hain?', a: 'Haan, agar aap ko dono saalon ki dohrai chahiye to chapters mein saaf likh dein.' },
    { q: 'Guess paper aur test paper mein kya farq hai?', a: 'Test paper aap ke chune hue chapters ki practice ke liye hai. Ahem sawalon par zor chahiye to order ke baad WhatsApp par bata dein.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="paper-heading">10th class: final ki tayyari</h2>
  <p class="mt-3">
    10th class matric ka aakhri saal hai, aur is ka result aage ke group aur college ke faisle par asar dalta hai. Is saal sab se
    zaroori cheez waqt ka sahih istemal aur poore syllabus ki baar baar dohrai hai. Test paper is dohrai ka sab se seedha tareeqa
    hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Board ke paper mein objective hissa jaldi aur sahih jawab mangta hai, is liye MCQs ki practice roz karein. Subjective mein short
    sawal ka jawab mukhtasar aur nukaati ho, aur long sawal mein tarteeb, headings aur diagrams se number milte hain. Maths aur
    Physics mein numericals ki practice ke baghair tayyari adhoori rehti hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Pre-board se pehle chhote chhote papers banwayen, maslan ek mazmoon ke do chapters. Imtihan ke qareeb poore syllabus ke papers
    waqt laga kar hal karein, jaise asal imtihan mein. Ghaltiyan ek copy mein likhte jayen aur agle paper se pehle unhein dekh
    lein.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Teachers aur academies pre-board ya send-up test ke liye bhi yeh paper istemal kar sakte hain. Order mein mazmoon, chapters aur
    kul number likhein; class pehle se 10th chuni hui hai. Date sheet aur roll number slip ke liye apne board ki official website
    dekhein.
  </p>
</BoardClassPage>
